TION (FOR TEMPORARY BAIL) NO. 24791 of\n2026\n================================================================\nMOHASIN ALIAS KALIYA ZAHIR AHMED SHAIKH\nVersus\nTHE STATE OF GUJARAT & ANR.\n================================================================\nAppearance:\nTHROUGH JAIL for the Applicant(s) No. 1\nMR DHAWAN JAYSWAL, APP for the Respondent(s) No. 1\n================================================================\nCORAM:HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE SANJEEV J.THAKER\nDate : 22/10/2026\nORAL ORDER\n1. This application, through jail, is filed by the applicant\nseeking temporary bail.\n2. Considering the jail remarks, it appears that the\napplicant has recently been arrested on 21.01.2025 and the\nfact that the conduct of the applicant is not good. Moreover,\nno justifiable reasons have been given in the application for\ngrant of temporary bail. Hence, no case is made out. The\napplication is rejected, accordingly.\n3. Registry to communicate this order to the concerned jail\nauthority.\n(SANJEEV J.THAKER,J)\nManoj Kumar Rai\nPage 1 of 1	1	t	GJHC010247912026	Judicial Precedent	2026-10-22	Single Bench	MOHASIN ALIAS KALIYA ZAHIR AHMED SHAIKH	State of Gujarat & Anr.	\N	\N	Civil Law	In this judgment under Criminal Law, the Court ruled on the dispute between Mohasin @ Kaliya Zahir Ahmed Shaikh and State of Gujarat & Anr..	0	2026 LexGuard (Judg) 370686	{"court": "High Court of Gujarat at Ahmedabad", "title": "Mohasin @ Kaliya Zahir Ahmed Shaikh v. State of Gujarat & Anr.", "case_id": "37068690-d808-48f6-a1fe-d85895b7d4b8", "case_no": "R/Criminal Misc. Application No. 24791 of 2026", "parties": "Mohasin @ Kaliya Zahir Ahmed Shaikh v. State of Gujarat & Anr.", "category": "BAIL_SUSPENSION", "petitioner": "Mohasin @ Kaliya Zahir Ahmed Shaikh", "respondent": "State of Gujarat & Anr.", "legal_domain": "Civil Law", "category_facts": {"category": "BAIL_SUSPENSION", "surety_count": null, "custody_period": null, "application_type": "Regular Bail", "bail_bond_amount": null, "trial_c