cumstances, the prayer\nfor bail is allowed.\n\n2\n5. It is ordered that the present accused petitioner\nmay find bail of Rs. 2,000/- with one registered surety of like\namount, subject to the satisfaction of the learned Chief Judicial\nMagistrate, Jalpaiguri, and on condition that the present\naccused petitioner shall meet the Investigating Officer of this\ncase once in a week till conclusion of investigation.\n6. Accordingly, CRM (M) 408 of 2026 is allowed\nand disposed of.\n7. All parties shall act in terms of server copy of the\norder downloaded from the official website of this Court.\n8. Urgent photostat certified copy of this order, if\napplied for, be supplied to the parties upon compliance with all\nrequisite formalities.\n(Partha Sarathi Sen, J.)	2	t	HCMA010004072026	Judicial Precedent	2026-10-23	Single Bench	Petitioner	Respondent / State	\N	\N	Civil & Constitutional Law	In this matter, the High Court at Calcutta adjudicated issues between Petitioner and Respondent / State. The Court rendered a decision disposing of the application under statutory provisions.	0	2026 LexGuard (CHC) 7ADAB437	{"court": "High Court at Calcutta", "title": "Petitioner v. Respondent / State", "case_id": "7adab437-76ea-43e8-b769-fccffddf5782", "case_no": "NO. 407 of 2026", "parties": "Petitioner v. Respondent / State", "category": "BAIL_SUSPENSION", "petitioner": "Petitioner", "respondent": "Respondent / State", "legal_domain": "Civil & Constitutional Law", "category_facts": {"category": "BAIL_SUSPENSION", "surety_count": null, "custody_period": null, "application_type": "Regular Bail", "bail_bond_amount": null, "trial_court_fine": null, "reason_for_relief": null, "reporting_condition": null, "trial_court_sentence": null, "trial_court_fine_paid": false}, "activity_events": [], "profile_version": "2.5", "statutory_matrix": [], "activity_clusters": [], "scenario_clusters": [], "scenario_keywords": [], "procedural_posture": {"remedy": "Allowed", "disposition": "Allowed"}}
